6952       * Run full model;
6953       proc logistic data=Exemplary;
6954       ods output parameterestimates=fitFull fitstatistics=statsFull;
6955       weight PY;
6956       model Y(event='1') = X1 X2 X1*X2;
6957       run;

NOTE: PROC LOGISTIC is modeling the probability that Y=1.
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The data set WORK.STATSFULL has 3 observations and 4 variables.
NOTE: The data set WORK.FITFULL has 4 observations and 7 variables.
NOTE: There were 40 observations read from the data set WORK.EXEMPLARY.
